Change administrator access

Usage:
  olr system set [command]

Available Commands:
  password    Set a password from stdin, or remove it for local recovery

Flags:
  -h, --help   help for set

Global Flags:
      --dry-run         show what would change and exit without applying it
  -o, --output string   output format: text|json (default "text")
      --socket string   olrd control socket (default "/run/olr/olrd.sock")

Use "olr system set [command] --help" for more information about a command.
